From: VyOS SRX build <noreply@localhost>
Subject: meson: build kea-msg-compiler in cross builds too

The cross guard skips kea-msg-compiler. Then TARGETS_GEN_MESSAGES stays empty
and meson.build stops with "No messages to generate", and
debian/isc-kea-dev.install misses usr/bin/kea-msg-compiler. Build it for the
host (target) arch like a native build does; it only runs for the manual
`messages` target. No change for native builds.

--- a/src/lib/log/compiler/meson.build
+++ b/src/lib/log/compiler/meson.build
@@ -1,7 +1,3 @@
-if meson.is_cross_build()
-    subdir_done()
-endif
-
 KEA_MSG_COMPILER = executable(
     'kea-msg-compiler',
     'message.cc',
